<body class="wp-singular page-template page-template-elementor_canvas page page-id-131 wp-embed-responsive wp-theme-twentytwentyfive elementor-default elementor-template-canvas elementor-kit-4 elementor-page elementor-page-131">
			<div data-elementor-type="wp-page" data-elementor-id="131" class="elementor elementor-131">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00000 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e00000-s " data-id="e00000" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00000">
    <section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00001 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e00001-s " data-id="e00001" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00001">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00002 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e00002-s " data-id="e00002" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00002">
    			<p class="e-30pe8n-e00003-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00003">KILNHOUSE</p>
					<p class="e-30pe8n-e00004-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00004">CATALOGUE N°4 · COIMBRA, PORTUGAL</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00005 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-30pe8n-e00005-s " data-id="e00005" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00005">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00006 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e00006-s " data-id="e00006" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00006">
    			<h1 data-interaction-id="e00007" class="e-30pe8n-e00007-s e-heading-base">Six pieces. One kiln. Made to outlive us.</h1>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00008 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e00008-s " data-id="e00008" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00008">
    			<p class="e-30pe8n-e00009-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00009">Flame-fired stoneware from a single workshop in Coimbra, thrown and glazed by four people whose names are on the box. No nonstick, no coatings, no seasoning rituals.</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000a e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e0000a-s " data-id="e0000a" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000a">
    			<p class="e-30pe8n-e0000b-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000b"><a href="#the-six-shapes" target="_self" class="e-paragraph-link-base">
		SEE THE SIX SHAPES
	</a></p>
					<p class="e-30pe8n-e0000c-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000c">Ships in 4 days from Portugal</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000d e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e0000d-s " data-id="e0000d" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000d" id="the-six-shapes">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000e e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e0000e-s " data-id="e0000e" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000e">
    			<h2 data-interaction-id="e0000f" class="e-30pe8n-e0000f-s e-heading-base">The six shapes</h2>
					<p class="e-30pe8n-e0000g-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000g">Six shapes is the whole range. We have made the same six since 2009 and have no plans for a seventh.</p>
		
</div>
			<img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" class="e-image-base e-30pe8n-e0000h-s" data-interaction-id="e0000h" id="127" src="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-kilnhouse-catalogue_still.jpg" width="1024" height="768" srcset="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-kilnhouse-catalogue_still.jpg 1024w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-kilnhouse-catalogue_still-300x225.jpg 300w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-kilnhouse-catalogue_still-768x576.jpg 768w" alt="Six stoneware shapes laid out on a linen cloth"/>		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000i e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-30pe8n-e0000i-s " data-id="e0000i" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0000i">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000j e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e0000j-s " data-id="e0000j" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000j">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000k e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e0000k-s " data-id="e0000k" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000k">
    			<p class="e-30pe8n-e0000l-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000l">01</p>
					<p class="e-30pe8n-e0000m-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000m">190 euro</p>
		
</div>
			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0000n" class="e-30pe8n-e0000n-s e-heading-base">The 26cm Braiser</h3>
					<p class="e-30pe8n-e0000o-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000o">Oven to table to fridge. The one most people start with.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000p e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e0000p-s " data-id="e0000p" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000p">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000q e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e0000q-s " data-id="e0000q" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000q">
    			<p class="e-30pe8n-e0000r-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000r">02</p>
					<p class="e-30pe8n-e0000s-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000s">165 euro</p>
		
</div>
			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0000t" class="e-30pe8n-e0000t-s e-heading-base">The 24cm Deep Skillet</h3>
					<p class="e-30pe8n-e0000u-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000u">Sears on the hob, finishes in the oven, keeps its heat on the board.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000v e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e0000v-s " data-id="e0000v" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000v">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000w e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e0000w-s " data-id="e0000w" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000w">
    			<p class="e-30pe8n-e0000x-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000x">03</p>
					<p class="e-30pe8n-e0000y-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000y">210 euro</p>
		
</div>
			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0000z" class="e-30pe8n-e0000z-s e-heading-base">The 3.5L Stockpot</h3>
					<p class="e-30pe8n-e00010-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00010">Stock, beans, and the long Sunday braise nobody watches.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00011 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e00011-s " data-id="e00011" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00011">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00012 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e00012-s " data-id="e00012" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00012">
    			<p class="e-30pe8n-e00013-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00013">04</p>
					<p class="e-30pe8n-e00014-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00014">145 euro</p>
		
</div>
			<h3 data-interaction-id="e00015" class="e-30pe8n-e00015-s e-heading-base">The 28cm Baking Dish</h3>
					<p class="e-30pe8n-e00016-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00016">Gratins, tray bakes, and a crumble that comes out edge-crisp.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00017 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e00017-s " data-id="e00017" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00017">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00018 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e00018-s " data-id="e00018" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00018">
    			<p class="e-30pe8n-e00019-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00019">05</p>
					<p class="e-30pe8n-e0001a-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001a">120 euro</p>
		
</div>
			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0001b" class="e-30pe8n-e0001b-s e-heading-base">The 1.2L Saucier</h3>
					<p class="e-30pe8n-e0001c-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001c">Sauces, grains, and dinner for one without apology.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001d e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e0001d-s " data-id="e0001d" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001d">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001e e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e0001e-s " data-id="e0001e" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001e">
    			<p class="e-30pe8n-e0001f-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001f">06</p>
					<p class="e-30pe8n-e0001g-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001g">175 euro</p>
		
</div>
			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0001h" class="e-30pe8n-e0001h-s e-heading-base">The 32cm Roasting Plate</h3>
					<p class="e-30pe8n-e0001i-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001i">A whole chicken with room around it, potatoes underneath.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
			<p class="e-30pe8n-e0001j-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001j">The 26cm Braiser, 190 euro, oven to table to fridge — the piece we would keep if we could only keep one.</p>
		
</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001k e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e0001k-s " data-id="e0001k" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001k">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001l e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-30pe8n-e0001l-s " data-id="e0001l" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0001l">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001m e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e0001m-s " data-id="e0001m" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001m">
    			<img decoding="async" class="e-image-base e-30pe8n-e0001n-s" data-interaction-id="e0001n" id="128" src="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-kilnhouse-glaze_macro.jpg" width="512" height="512" srcset="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-kilnhouse-glaze_macro.jpg 512w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-kilnhouse-glaze_macro-300x300.jpg 300w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-kilnhouse-glaze_macro-150x150.jpg 150w" alt="Macro detail of a flame-fired glaze surface"/>		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001o e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e0001o-s " data-id="e0001o" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001o">
    			<h2 data-interaction-id="e0001p" class="e-30pe8n-e0001p-s e-heading-base">Four glazes</h2>
					<p class="e-30pe8n-e0001q-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001q">Four glazes: Ash, Ox Blood, Fig, Raw. Every one is food-safe and lead-free, tested twice a year. Each pot takes the fire differently, so no two leave the kiln identical.</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001r e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-30pe8n-e0001r-s " data-id="e0001r" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0001r">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001s e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e0001s-s " data-id="e0001s" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001s">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001t e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e0001t-s " data-id="e0001t" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001t">
    
</div>
			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0001u" class="e-30pe8n-e0001u-s e-heading-base">Ash</h3>
					<p class="e-30pe8n-e0001v-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001v">Pale, matte, moves in the fire</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001w e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e0001w-s " data-id="e0001w" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001w">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001x e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e0001x-s " data-id="e0001x" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001x">
    
</div>
			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0001y" class="e-30pe8n-e0001y-s e-heading-base">Ox Blood</h3>
					<p class="e-30pe8n-e0001z-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001z">Deep red, pooling at the foot</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00020 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e00020-s " data-id="e00020" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00020">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00021 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e00021-s " data-id="e00021" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00021">
    
</div>
			<h3 data-interaction-id="e00022" class="e-30pe8n-e00022-s e-heading-base">Fig</h3>
					<p class="e-30pe8n-e00023-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00023">Bruised purple, near black in shade</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00024 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e00024-s " data-id="e00024" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00024">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00025 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e00025-s " data-id="e00025" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00025">
    
</div>
			<h3 data-interaction-id="e00026" class="e-30pe8n-e00026-s e-heading-base">Raw</h3>
					<p class="e-30pe8n-e00027-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00027">Unglazed outside, glazed within</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00028 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e00028-s " data-id="e00028" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00028">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00029 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e00029-s " data-id="e00029" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00029">
    			<h2 data-interaction-id="e0002a" class="e-30pe8n-e0002a-s e-heading-base">How it is fired</h2>
					<p class="e-30pe8n-e0002b-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002b">Four people. Two days in the kiln. One address.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002c e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-30pe8n-e0002c-s " data-id="e0002c" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0002c">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002d e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e0002d-s " data-id="e0002d" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002d">
    			<img decoding="async" class="e-image-base e-30pe8n-e0002e-s" data-interaction-id="e0002e" id="129" src="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-kilnhouse-kiln_firing.jpg" width="768" height="1024" srcset="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-kilnhouse-kiln_firing.jpg 768w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-kilnhouse-kiln_firing-225x300.jpg 225w" alt="Stoneware being fired in the Coimbra kiln"/>					<p class="e-30pe8n-e0002f-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002f">01</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0002g" class="e-30pe8n-e0002g-s e-heading-base">Thrown</h3>
					<p class="e-30pe8n-e0002h-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002h">Every piece is thrown on the wheel in Coimbra, one of six shapes, no moulds.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002i e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e0002i-s " data-id="e0002i" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002i">
    			<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="e-image-base e-30pe8n-e0002j-s" data-interaction-id="e0002j" id="128" src="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-kilnhouse-glaze_macro.jpg" width="512" height="512" srcset="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-kilnhouse-glaze_macro.jpg 512w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-kilnhouse-glaze_macro-300x300.jpg 300w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-kilnhouse-glaze_macro-150x150.jpg 150w" alt="Macro detail of a flame-fired glaze surface"/>					<p class="e-30pe8n-e0002k-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002k">02</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0002l" class="e-30pe8n-e0002l-s e-heading-base">Glazed</h3>
					<p class="e-30pe8n-e0002m-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002m">Dipped by hand in one of four glazes, food-safe and lead-free, tested twice a year.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002n e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e0002n-s " data-id="e0002n" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002n">
    			<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="e-image-base e-30pe8n-e0002o-s" data-interaction-id="e0002o" id="127" src="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-kilnhouse-catalogue_still.jpg" width="1024" height="768" srcset="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-kilnhouse-catalogue_still.jpg 1024w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-kilnhouse-catalogue_still-300x225.jpg 300w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-kilnhouse-catalogue_still-768x576.jpg 768w" alt="Six stoneware shapes laid out on a linen cloth"/>					<p class="e-30pe8n-e0002p-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002p">03</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0002q" class="e-30pe8n-e0002q-s e-heading-base">Fired</h3>
					<p class="e-30pe8n-e0002r-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002r">Flame-fired to 1280°C over two days. The kiln decides the last ten percent.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002s e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e0002s-s " data-id="e0002s" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002s">
    			<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="e-image-base e-30pe8n-e0002t-s" data-interaction-id="e0002t" id="130" src="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-kilnhouse-kitchen_use.jpg" width="1024" height="576" srcset="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-kilnhouse-kitchen_use.jpg 1024w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-kilnhouse-kitchen_use-300x169.jpg 300w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-kilnhouse-kitchen_use-768x432.jpg 768w" alt="Kilnhouse braiser in use on a home kitchen hob"/>					<p class="e-30pe8n-e0002u-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002u">04</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0002v" class="e-30pe8n-e0002v-s e-heading-base">Checked and boxed</h3>
					<p class="e-30pe8n-e0002w-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002w">Rung for tone, checked for crazing, signed by the four people who made it.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002x e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e0002x-s " data-id="e0002x" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002x">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002y e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-30pe8n-e0002y-s " data-id="e0002y" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0002y">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002z e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e0002z-s " data-id="e0002z" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002z">
    			<h2 data-interaction-id="e00030" class="e-30pe8n-e00030-s e-heading-base">What it takes, and what it will not</h2>
					<p class="e-30pe8n-e00031-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00031">Dishwasher yes. Thermal shock no. Do not take it from freezer to a hot oven and it will see out your kitchen.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00032 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e00032-s " data-id="e00032" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00032">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00033 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-30pe8n-e00033-s " data-id="e00033" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00033">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00034 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e00034-s " data-id="e00034" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00034">
    			<p class="e-30pe8n-e00035-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00035">IT CAN TAKE</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00036 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e00036-s " data-id="e00036" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00036">
    			<p class="e-30pe8n-e00037-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00037">+</p>
					<p class="e-30pe8n-e00038-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00038">The dishwasher, every day, forever</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00039 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e00039-s " data-id="e00039" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00039">
    			<p class="e-30pe8n-e0003a-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003a">+</p>
					<p class="e-30pe8n-e0003b-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003b">The oven to 260°C, lid on or off</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003c e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e0003c-s " data-id="e0003c" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003c">
    			<p class="e-30pe8n-e0003d-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003d">+</p>
					<p class="e-30pe8n-e0003e-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003e">Gas, electric, induction, open flame</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003f e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e0003f-s " data-id="e0003f" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003f">
    			<p class="e-30pe8n-e0003g-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003g">+</p>
					<p class="e-30pe8n-e0003h-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003h">Metal spoons, knives, whisks</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003i e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e0003i-s " data-id="e0003i" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003i">
    			<p class="e-30pe8n-e0003j-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003j">+</p>
					<p class="e-30pe8n-e0003k-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003k">Straight from oven to table to fridge</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003l e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e0003l-s " data-id="e0003l" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003l">
    			<p class="e-30pe8n-e0003m-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003m">IT CANNOT</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003n e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e0003n-s " data-id="e0003n" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003n">
    			<p class="e-30pe8n-e0003o-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003o">—</p>
					<p class="e-30pe8n-e0003p-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003p">Freezer to a hot oven — thermal shock</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003q e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e0003q-s " data-id="e0003q" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003q">
    			<p class="e-30pe8n-e0003r-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003r">—</p>
					<p class="e-30pe8n-e0003s-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003s">A cold sink under a hot pan</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003t e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e0003t-s " data-id="e0003t" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003t">
    			<p class="e-30pe8n-e0003u-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003u">—</p>
					<p class="e-30pe8n-e0003v-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003v">Empty on a high flame for ten minutes</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003w e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e0003w-s " data-id="e0003w" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003w">
    			<p class="e-30pe8n-e0003x-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003x">—</p>
					<p class="e-30pe8n-e0003y-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003y">Bleach or oven cleaner, it does not need it</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003z e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e0003z-s " data-id="e0003z" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003z">
    			<p class="e-30pe8n-e00040-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00040">—</p>
					<p class="e-30pe8n-e00041-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00041">Seasoning. There is no coating to feed.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00042 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e00042-s " data-id="e00042" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00042">
    			<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="e-image-base e-30pe8n-e00043-s" data-interaction-id="e00043" id="130" src="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-kilnhouse-kitchen_use.jpg" width="1024" height="576" srcset="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-kilnhouse-kitchen_use.jpg 1024w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-kilnhouse-kitchen_use-300x169.jpg 300w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-kilnhouse-kitchen_use-768x432.jpg 768w" alt="Kilnhouse braiser in use on a home kitchen hob"/>		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00044 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e00044-s " data-id="e00044" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00044">
    			<p class="e-30pe8n-e00045-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00045">The 26cm Braiser, Ox Blood, in its fourth year in a Lisbon kitchen.</p>
					<p class="e-30pe8n-e00046-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00046">PHOTOGRAPHED UNRETOUCHED</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00047 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e00047-s " data-id="e00047" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00047">
    			<h2 data-interaction-id="e00048" class="e-30pe8n-e00048-s e-heading-base">Lifetime replacement, in plain terms</h2>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00049 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-30pe8n-e00049-s " data-id="e00049" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00049">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004a e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e0004a-s " data-id="e0004a" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004a">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0004b" class="e-30pe8n-e0004b-s e-heading-base">Ten years</h3>
					<p class="e-30pe8n-e0004c-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004c">Crack it in the first ten years and we replace it once, no receipt required.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004d e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e0004d-s " data-id="e0004d" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004d">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0004e" class="e-30pe8n-e0004e-s e-heading-base">Shipping</h3>
					<p class="e-30pe8n-e0004f-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004f">Ships in 4 days from Portugal. Free over 120 euro in the EU and UK.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004g e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e0004g-s " data-id="e0004g" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004g">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0004h" class="e-30pe8n-e0004h-s e-heading-base">Returns</h3>
					<p class="e-30pe8n-e0004i-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004i">Thirty days to change your mind, used or not. Send it back in the same box it arrived in.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004j e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e0004j-s " data-id="e0004j" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004j" id="order">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004k e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-30pe8n-e0004k-s " data-id="e0004k" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0004k">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004l e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e0004l-s " data-id="e0004l" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004l">
    			<h2 data-interaction-id="e0004m" class="e-30pe8n-e0004m-s e-heading-base">Order a piece</h2>
					<p class="e-30pe8n-e0004n-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004n">Tell us the shape and the glaze. We write back the same week, from the workshop, with a firing date.</p>
					<p class="e-30pe8n-e0004o-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004o">Rua das Olarias 12, 3000 Coimbra · hello@kilnhouse.pt</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004p e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-30pe8n-e0004p-s " data-id="e0004p" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004p">
    		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004q elementor-widget elementor-widget-html" data-id="e0004q" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="html.default">
					
<form class="kh-order" method="post" action="#order" onsubmit="return false" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:18px 20px;font-family:Karla,sans-serif;">
  <label style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#221D18;">
    Shape
    <select name="shape" style="font-family:Karla,sans-serif;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:0;text-transform:none;padding:13px 12px;border:1px solid #CDC3B4;background:#FFFFFF;color:#221D18;border-radius:0;">
      <option>The 26cm Braiser — 190 euro</option>
      <option>The 24cm Deep Skillet — 165 euro</option>
      <option>The 3.5L Stockpot — 210 euro</option>
      <option>The 28cm Baking Dish — 145 euro</option>
      <option>The 1.2L Saucier — 120 euro</option>
      <option>The 32cm Roasting Plate — 175 euro</option>
    </select>
  </label>
  <label style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#221D18;">
    Glaze
    <select name="glaze" style="font-family:Karla,sans-serif;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:0;text-transform:none;padding:13px 12px;border:1px solid #CDC3B4;background:#FFFFFF;color:#221D18;border-radius:0;">
      <option>Ash</option><option>Ox Blood</option><option>Fig</option><option>Raw</option>
    </select>
  </label>
  <label style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#221D18;">
    Name
    <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="Who is it for" style="font-family:Karla,sans-serif;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:0;text-transform:none;padding:13px 12px;border:1px solid #CDC3B4;background:#FFFFFF;color:#221D18;border-radius:0;">
  </label>
  <label style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#221D18;">
    Email
    <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="you@example.com" style="font-family:Karla,sans-serif;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:0;text-transform:none;padding:13px 12px;border:1px solid #CDC3B4;background:#FFFFFF;color:#221D18;border-radius:0;">
  </label>
  <label style="grid-column:1 / -1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#221D18;">
    Anything we should know
    <textarea name="note" rows="3" placeholder="Gift note, delivery window, a question about the glaze" style="font-family:Karla,sans-serif;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:0;text-transform:none;padding:13px 12px;border:1px solid #CDC3B4;background:#FFFFFF;color:#221D18;border-radius:0;resize:vertical;"></textarea>
  </label>
  <div style="grid-column:1 / -1;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;">
    <button type="submit" style="font-family:Karla,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:16px 30px;border:0;background:#B4572F;color:#F4EFE6;cursor:pointer;">Place the order</button>
    <span style="font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#221D18;">Ships in 4 days from Portugal. Free over 120 euro in the EU and UK.</span>
  </div>
</form>
<style>
@media (max-width: 767px) { .kh-order { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr) !important; } }
</style>
				</div>
		
</div>

</div>
